    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 31.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hloð ðis gedó ⁊ eft oðswerian wille, tio hie ealle; ⁊ þonne ealle forgielden þone wer gemænum hondum ⁊ ealle án wite, swa to ðam were belimpe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the band should do this, and afterwards wish to deny it, let them all be accused; and then let all pay the wer communally and all a single fine, such as is appropriate to the wer.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a band of marauders acts thus and afterwards wishes to deny it, thay shall all be accused, and then all collectively shall pay the wergeld and fine—whichever is appropriate to the wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hloð ðis gedó ond eft oþswerian wille, teo (man) hy ealle; ond þonne ealle forgilden ðone wær gemænum hondum ond ealle ón wite, swa to þam were belimpe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
